{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00664","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享太庙乐章 凯安四章 三 · 张说","name":"郊庙歌辞 享太庙乐章 凯安四章 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"总总干戚，填填鼓钟。\n奋扬争气，坐作爲容。\n离若鸷鸟，合如战龙。\n万方观德，肃肃雝雝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00664.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00664","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}